not reducing headcount at this stage in response to COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q1","e":"snn","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ian Melling","x":"We're also conscious of conserving cash where possible by slowing capex programs, although the long lead time on instrument sets limits how quickly we can react on that component and by managing costs related to restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q2","e":"snn","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Diggelmann","x":"Trading profit was $172 million, with trading margins of 8.5%, reflects negative operating leverage and higher provision charges, offset by cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q2","e":"snn","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ian Melling","x":"To mitigate these impacts, we have delivered approximately $150 million of cost savings in areas such as variable pay, third-party commissions and royalties, travel, promotional activity, events and consultancy spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q3","e":"snn","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anne-Francoise Nesmes","x":"So I'll take the question then, Roland, around margin to the extent.Whilst I say, I remind you around the cost savings we've put in place to mitigate the impact of COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q3","e":"snn","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Diggelmann","x":"I'm pleased to report that we have not had any layoffs nor furloughing as a matter of fact in the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q4","e":"snn","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anne-Francoise Nesmes","x":"Our IFRS operating profit of $295 million after restructuring costs, acquisition, amortization, legal and other charges incurred in the year was 200 -- sorry, the IFRS profit was $259 million after all of the costs as I've just mentioned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"SNN 2020 Q4","e":"snn","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anne-Francoise Nesmes","x":"To mitigate the impacts of COVID, we delivered approximately $280 million of cost savings compared to our original budget for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"SNN 2021 Q1","e":"snn","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roland Diggelmann","x":"It targets around $200 million of annualized cost savings by the end of 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"SNN 2021 Q1","e":"snn","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anne-Francoise Nesmes","x":"Also, if you take the organization as a whole, and we should not underestimate that, there's effectively two years of price erosion, two years of cost inflation, which were partially offsetting with our restructuring, with our process efficiencies, activity and process improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/smith-nephew-plc-snn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"SNN 2021 Q3","e":"snn","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anne-Francoise Nesmes","x":"You'll recall 